| Area | Rules | Key Files |
|------|-------|-----------|
| Security | 1-7 | vercel.json, .env |
| Caching | 8-11 | vercel.json, api/revalidate |
| Images | 12-15 | src/components/common/Image.astro |
| SSL | 16-17 | Cloudflare settings |
| Backups | 18-21 | scripts/sanity-export.ts |
| SEO | 22-35 | src/components/common/Metadata.astro |
