## Security (1-7)
1. Cloudflare: DNS, CDN, DDoS, WAF, Bot Fight, rate limits, Full (strict) SSL
2. Cloudflare+Vercel: Team acknowledges proxy setup
3. Headers: HSTS, nosniff, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy, X-Frame-Options
4. Secrets: Vercel env + 1Password only. Never Git.
5. Sanity CORS: Production domains only, server-side tokens
6. GitHub: 2FA, protected main, secret scanning, Dependabot, npm audit CI
7. No Leftovers: Remove test endpoints, staging links, unused packages

## Caching (8-11)
8. Static: /_astro/* 1yr immutable. HTML not cached.
9. No Cloudflare HTML cache unless purge-on-deploy
10. Sanity webhook triggers Vercel deploy hook (static rebuild)
11. Test that publish updates page within 60s

## Images (12-15)
12. Before upload: max 2000px, <100KB, hero <250KB
13. Astro Image + urlFor auto=format, responsive srcset
14. Set width/height, lazy below fold, hero not lazy
15. Self-host fonts WOFF2, font-display: swap

## SSL (16-17)
16. HTTPS everywhere, HTTP->HTTPS redirect, HSTS on
17. No extra certs unless needed

## Backups (18-21)
18. (removed)
19. Rollback: Vercel Instant or redeploy a previous deployment
20. Sanity export: weekly, before schema changes, on release
21. Single S3 bucket for backups

## SEO (22-35)
22. Shared components: build once, reuse everywhere
23. GTM base layout only, GSC via DNS TXT
24. Unique title/description/canonical per page
25. ONE fallback approach (site.ts or Sanity)
26. robots.txt in code, staging noindex
27. Sitemap auto via import.meta.glob + Sanity
28. Sitemap with _updatedAt lastmod
29. Schema: Organization, WebSite, WebPage, Breadcrumb, BlogPosting, Service, LocalBusiness, FAQ
30. Schema override field in Sanity
31. SEO panel: title, desc, canonical, noindex, OG image
32. Site settings for LocalBusiness schema
33. OG + Twitter tags every page
34. Alt text required on all images
35. One H1, headings in order

## Monitoring (36-38)
36. HetrixTools uptime from launch
37. Strix scan before launch, after changes
38. Deploy alerts to Slack

## Automated Checks (39-41)
39. npm run seo:check
40. npm run links:check
41. (removed)

## Forms (42-44)
42. Turnstile + honeypot, server validation
43. Rate limit, no open relay
44. Resend with reply-to as visitor email

## Cookies (45-47)
45. Banner: Necessary, Analytics, Marketing, Preferences
46. GTM Consent Mode v2: denied by default
47. EU/UK strict, US notice OK

## Blog (48)
48. /blog and /blog/[slug] templates

## DNS (49-52)
49. Save zone before changes
50. Cloudflare DNS, apex + www to Vercel
51. Test 301s and email after switch
52. Keep old hosting 48hrs

## Code (53-58)
53. Rules files: CLAUDE.md, .cursor/rules/, AGENTS.md
54. Size: components 200, pages 150, functions 50 lines
55. No copied blocks, use design tokens + props
56. Zero JS default, Astro islands only when needed
57. (removed)
58. Single config source per value

## Sanity (59-63)
59. Shared schemas: seo, imageWithAlt, portableText, cta
60. Block publish if title/slug/alt missing
61. All queries in src/lib/content/sanity.ts
62. Handle slug changes (301 or flag)
63. Separate production/staging datasets

## Speed (64-67)
64. Astro prefetch on, static where possible
65. Form loading state, no double-submit
66. Test throttled mobile, Lighthouse > 90
67. Sitemap: s-maxage=300

